<title>JAPAN: Hakone Tozan - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hakone Tozan - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.78		vs	    6.77</p>
<p> Operating	  166    mln	  vs	  207    mln</p>
<p> Current	loss 18    mln	  vs	 prft 29 mln</p>
<p> Net	    loss 60    mln	  vs	 prft 11 mln</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 1.51 yen	  vs     prft 0.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     40 million	  vs	  40 million</p>
<p> Interim div	     --	     vs		 --</p>
<p>NOTE - Hakone Tozan Railway Co Ltd is a tourist and mountain railway operator affiliated with Odakyu Electric Railway Co Ltd.</p>
